<title>FRANCE: CDR Creances bonds suspended - SBF.</title>
<headline>CDR Creances bonds suspended - SBF.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bonds in CDR Creances have been suspended pending a statement from the agency, which groups Credit Lyonnais assets for sale, the Paris stockmarkets association SBF said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said the suspension of the bonds had been requested by CDR.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
